et to share your feedback with us and join the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:35:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690807","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-712370-1844751498231669","game_id":"steam-712370","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the demo in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Heroes, we have news! ⚔️ We know many of you have been eagerly waiting for your first look at Fallen Sword II, and we’re excited to announce that a public demo will be coming at the end of October 19-26 as part of Steam Next Fest 2026!Wishlist on Steam now to be among the first to jump into the game when we go live!Here's what you can expect:DON'T FORGET TO CLAIM YOUR NAME!Bring your classic Fallen Sword name into this next adventure! If you already play Fallen Sword, you will be able to reserve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T14:39:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498231669","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-712370-1842846814440823","game_id":"steam-712370","kind":"announcement","title":"Reserve Your Name","summary":"Adventurers, If you play the original Fallen Sword, you can reserve your current character name for the new adventure by logging in with your Hunted Cow account. The reservation window is open for a limited time. Reservations close on 1st October Complete your reservation before the deadline to secure your current Fallen Sword character name for Fallen Sword II. How to reserve your name Visit fs2.game. Choose Reserve Your Name in the navigation, then Log In to Reserve. Log in with the Hunted Cow","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T15:53:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814440823","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-712370-1841579228662906","game_id":"steam-712370","kind":"announcement","title":"Fallen Sword II teaser trailer!","summary":"Heroes,We have for you our very first Fallen Sword II teaser trailer! Step back into the world of Erildath and get your first glimpse of what's to come as a new Champion rises to face the darkness.Watch the teaser and wishlist the game on Steam:And that's not all...Next month, we'll be sharing some news about when you'll finally be able to get your hands on Fallen Sword II. Keep an eye on your inbox - you won't want to miss it.Thank you for being part of this journey. We can't wait to show you w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T15:07:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228662906","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-712370-1839676055885675","game_id":"steam-712370","kind":"announcement","title":"DESCEND INTO THE DUNGEONS: Fallen Sword II Dev Blog","summary":"To open new realms and advance the main questline, you may need to pass through a Dungeon.Dungeons are perilous realms where the enemies get tougher the deeper you dare to go. Each dungeon features a number of branching pathways and a series of trials marked by Stage Nodes.Each stage holds a random event, whether that's a monster spoiling for a fight or a chance to catch your breath at a campfire.Reach the end of a dungeon and defeat the Dungeon Boss to earn your passage back to the main realms,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T15:42:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055885675","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-712370-1835871199304410","game_id":"steam-712370","kind":"announcement","title":"COMBAT REFORGED: Fallen Sword II Dev Blog","summary":"Does this sound familiar? WASD to move. Hit 1234567890. Repeat until out of stamina…or until accidentally dead.In Fallen Sword II, combat looks a little different. While still honouring our RPG roots, we’re bringing more strategy and flexibility to the battle side of things.Grab a brew, adventurer, and let’s talk about the new paths for combat coming to Fallen Sword II.SKILL PATHSSkill Paths (Pathways) are themed trees that let you unlock Actions and passive Skills using Skill Points earned by l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T14:20:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199304410","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-712370-1830163047266705","game_id":"steam-712370","kind":"announcement","title":"Fallen Sword II Medieval Fest April 20-27!","summary":"We’re excited to be taking part in Medieval Fest from April 20-27!You can support the development of this project by wishlisting today. Step into the world of Fallen Sword II and rise as Erildath’s newest Champion. Journey across vast realms, delve into perilous dungeons, and carve your own path through a land steeped in medieval legend with a fantasy twist.Will you take up arms as a noble knight, strike from the shadows as a ranger, or master the arcane as a cleric? The choice is yours. Gather ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-20T17:02:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047266705","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-712370-1819386365086886","game_id":"steam-712370","kind":"announcement","title":"Fallen Sword II is coming!","summary":"Due to launch for the 20th anniversary of the Fallen Sword franchise, Fallen Sword II is a spiritual successor to the game you know and love - a fresh adventure set in the world of Erildath with modern gameplay, stunning visuals, and all the depth you'd expect from a Fallen Sword title. Experience the features you’re already familiar with, reimagined and updated for a new journey. Battle formidable foes in fast-paced turn-based combat, venture into perilous Gauntlets, master six heroic classes, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-17T14:41:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365086886","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-712370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:50:46Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:50:46Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-712370":"2026-10-26T09:50:46Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"712370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:50:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:50:46Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:50:46Z"},"5253500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:50:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:50:46Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:50:46Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-712370","app_id":712370,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:06Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_